ice single" id="frequencyChoice"><button type="button" data-v="often">Often</button><button type="button" data-v="sometimes">Sometimes</button><button type="button" data-v="rarely">Rarely</button><button type="button" data-v="none">Not at all</button></div></div>
        <div class="privacy-note">This is a research prototype. Your test session is saved automatically when a research server is available; no account is required.</div>
        <div class="intake-error" id="intakeError"></div>
        <button class="cta" style="width:100%" onclick="saveIntake()">Continue</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Onboarding 1 -->
    <section class="screen onboard" id="on1">
      <div><div class="status"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div><div class="topbar"><button class="icon-btn" onclick="show('splash')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span style="width:40px"></span></div></div>
      <div class="art"><div class="on-card"><div class="tiny">The part profiles usually miss</div><div class="big">In my head, I’m…</div><div class="quote">“Much braver than my actual life suggests. I should probably live near the sea and kiss people first.”</div></div></div>
      <div><h2>One question that can tell you more.</h2><p>Not a résumé. Not a personality test. Just one small place to show something real that a normal profile rarely catches.</p><div class="dots"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot on"></span><span class="dot"></span></div><button class="cta" style="width:100%" onclick="show('on2')">Next</button></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Onboarding 2 -->
    <section class="screen onboard" id="on2">
      <div><div class="status"><span>9:41</span><span>●●●</span></div><div class="topbar"><button class="icon-btn" onclick="show('on1')">←</button><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><span style="width:40px"></span></div></div>
      <div class="art"><div class="gesture-demo"><div class="demo-heart"><svg viewBox="0 0 294 116"><defs><linearGradient id="dg1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop stop-color="#ff7898"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#c28cff"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="dg2" x1="1" x2="0"><stop stop-color="#73d8c7"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#8f82ff"/></linearGradient></defs><path class="demo-glow" d="M26 70 C52 71 72 66 89 48 C100 36 108 21 121 21 C133 21 141 29 145 42" stroke="url(#dg1)"/><path class="demo-glow" d="M268 70 C242 71 222 66 205 48 C194 36 186 21 173 21 C161 21 153 29 149 42" stroke="url(#dg2)"/><path class="demo-line" d="M26 70 C52 71 72 66 89 48 C100 36 108 21 121 21 C133 21 141 29 145 42" stroke="url(#dg1)"/><path class="demo-line" d="M268 70 C242 71 222 66 205 48 C194 36 186 21 173 21 C161 21 153 29 149 42" stroke="url(#dg2)"/><path class="demo-spark" d="M142 38 L147 43 L152 38"/><path class="demo-heart-trace" d="M147 78 C121 58 108 43 111 29 C115 14 132 15 141 29 C144 33 146 37 147 42 C148 37 150 33 153 29 C162 15 179 14 183 29 C186 43 173 58 147 78" stroke="#9d8cf8"/></svg></div><div class="hint">Bring the two lines together</div></div></div>
      <div><h2>Don’t swipe right. Connect.</h2><p>A positive choice takes a tiny bit more intention. Pull the two lines together. If you change your mind, let go. If it’s a no, flick one away.</p><div class="dots"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot on"></span></div><button class="cta" style="width:100%" onclick="startResearch();show('discover');loadCard()">Try the 20-profile test</button></div>
    </section>

